<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">- Bekwel Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Koolɛt Bɔɔba</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Kl</para>
  <para style="toc2">Koolɛt yii Bɔɔba</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mɛkana ɛ Pɔl yii Bhɔɔba, pɛ daa Bot ɛ ghaada Koolɛt</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mɛkana ɛ Pɔl yii bhɔɔba</para>
  <para style="mt1">Pɛ dáa bot ɛ ghaada Koolɛt</para>
  <para style="imt">Ɛniel</para>
  <para style="ip">Ye nabɛ ɛ́ Pɔl naakwyal mɛkana mɛ yii mɛkɛn pɛ dáa bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala mɛ ghaada Koolɛt. Ye ɛ́ bhis mɛkana mɛ tak ɛ, nyɛ nabaabela menduk mɔɔ (bot ɛ aabela ye ɛ́ tɔ <char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 2:3">2.3</ref></char>). Eghɛŋ tak, ɛgwakel ɛ Pɔl nɛ bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala mɛ Koolɛt nabɛ ɛ́ ye moo ɛbiyoɛpe. Ɛsok nɛ nyɛ nɛ baatɔ́ pɛ ghaada Koolɛt, Pɔl nakyeed bɛ bɛmɛkana tɔ ɛbwaalel náá, etɛp binek ɛ aaswola.</para>
  <para style="io1">Tɔ mɛlaŋel <char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 1-7">1—7</ref></char>, Pɔl ɛpebaŋa mbi <char style="em">mot lwoma</char>nyɛ di ɛ, ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ, nyɛ mot Yezu Klisto nakyeed pɛ daa bɛdhiiti bot ɛ. Ye kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ́ náá, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ <char style="em">kwom mɛsa ɛ Zɛɛb</char>. E geka bɛ ɛ́ náá, edi djas bot gu Zɛɛb Sɛɛg nɛ Yezu Klisto. Tɔ mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb nadjɛ nyɛ ɛ́, nyɛ naaboma nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ mezuk, nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ embee etɛp. Nyɛ naamaad yɛ nɛ lyem ɛdjisal. É sok nyɛ nadi elii etɛp nyel'ɛ deenek ɛ, Pɔl nadi ebwal ɛgek náá, bot ɛ ghaada Koolɛt aanàkwaakin nyɛ nɛ mɛlyo mɛ.</para>
  <para style="io1">Tɔ mɛlaŋel <char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 8-9">8—9</ref></char>, Pɔl ɛpewaab nɛ ekeletyɛ ghaada Koolɛt náá, bɛ gwyena nɛ lyem wat nɛ ekeletyɛ ghaada Yeluzalɛm di bɛdjel ɛ bot ɔ. Bɛdhiiti bot tɔ zɛɛga mendjaala di nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ ekum ɛbuɛpe ɔ, goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛkwyee ɛ bot di ààbɛ nɛ yɛ ɔ. Eghɛŋ Pɔl nadi ekwyal mɛkana ɛ, ghaada Koolɛt nabɛ ɛ́ ghaada wat nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ ekum. Tɛtɛ mɛsa mɔɔ nabɛ ɛ́ ɛbɔmsa esa, deenek, elyem bɔɔ nabɛ ɛ́ kwyesa tɔ gwyes ɛbela epata. Mɛlaŋel menek ɛpepus bɛ náá, bɛkum ɛ bot nɛ bɛdjel ɛ bot di edi wat. Yezu Klisto mot nadi kum mot ɔ, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nyɛ moo djel étɛp bot ɛ bɔs needi bɛkum ɛ bot kɔ ɛsu edjel bɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 8:9">8.9</ref></char>). Yenek ɛpesa náá, <char style="em">ɛgwakel</char> di pak bot ɛ bɔs.</para>
  <para style="io1">Tɔ mɛlaŋel <char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 10-13">10—13</ref></char>, Pɔl ɛpetyaa nɛ mbee membi membá mɛ ɛsa mɛsa ɛ Yezu Klisto. Bot ɛ zɛɛga ndjaa mendjaala nabɛ ɛ́ bɛ moo zɛm-zɛm kɔ ɛsu ɛ bot di egoola dhiiti mbi bhaadal di àànɔŋel nɛ yii Pɔl ɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 11:3-4">11.3-4</ref></char>). Bot ɛ zɛɛga ndjaa mendjaala nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ moo wa lyem tɔ membi mɛ etɛp bot nadi egoola dhiiti mbi bhaadal nadi elɛɛ bɛ ɛ. Bɛ ɛpelɛɛ bot náá, bɛ ɛ́ «eboo bot ɛ lwoma». Bɛ ɛ́ nɛ kwyes lii. Bɛ ɛ́ nɛ dek. Bɛ ɛpeghɛɛ mɛnyel nɛ sa bɛ di esa ɛ. Yenek djas ɛpenɔŋel nɛ membi mɛ esesɛɛ di esael kɔ ghaada Koolɛt ɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pɔl ɛpelyaal dáa mot-lwoma di egoka nɛ ɛdi ɛ. <char style="em">Mot lwoma ɛ Yezu Klisto goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi tɔ mɛsila,</char> étɛp nyɛ neeben bɛdhiiti bot. Nyɛ eemyaal ɛdi tsakbel mot, étɛp nyɛ ɛpegwaal ɛbela ghwyil di edus pɛ daa Zɛɛb. Nyɛ ààdji dhiiti sonok kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ met, ààbɛ duu, kat-katak mɛvu. Pɔl ɛpebaalɛɛ náá, nyɛ naagoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal nɛ bot ɛ Koolɛt ààwaab bɛ epata. Ye ɛ́ dhiiti mbi e ɛlɛɛ nɛ bot náá, kwyɛl Zɛɛb di nɛ yɛ nɛ nena ɛ, ye tok étɛp epata. Deenek, Zɛɛb ààpawaab mena dhiiti sonok.</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1"/>
  <para style="s">Mɛswosel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1"/>Ye ɛ́ mam Pɔl, mot-lwoma ɛ Yezu Klisto tɔ ɛkwosak ɛ Zɛɛb, bis nɛ Timote mɔn nyɛɛg'ena ɛ́ kwyal mɛkana mak. Bis eeswos bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala di pɛ kyee ghaada Koolɛt, nɛ bot ɛ kyee dik Akayi djas di eduwal Zɛɛb ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2"/>Beta náá, Zɛɛb Sɛɛg'enaka nɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu Klisto djɛ bin enɛm nɛ embɛɛ, nɛ egwyem.<verse eid="2CO 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl ɛpeghaapɛɛ Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3"/>Djhooduwalka Zɛɛb, Sɛɛg ɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto. Nyɛ ɛ́ Sɛɛg'enaka mot di nɛ ghoŋ nɛ bot ɔ. Nyɛ ɛ́ Zɛɛb mot di edjɛ bot ghwyil sok membi mɛ etɛp djas ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4"/>Nyɛ nɛ djɛ mena mɛghaaz tɔ membi mɛ mezuk djas, etɛɛ náá mena needjɛka pe bɛdhiiti bot ɛ di tɔ mezuk ɔ mɛghaaz. Ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, mena ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛsa deenek ɔ, ye ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb nanyel ɛdjɛ bis ghwyil tak sok. <verse eid="2CO 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5"/>Tin, mena zukeka ɛbuɛpe tyee wat nɛ dáa Klisto nazuk ɛ. Ye ɛ́ bɛ náá mena di ezukeka ɔ, Zɛɛb waadjɛka mena mɛghaaz mɛ Klisto dhaa nyel. <verse eid="2CO 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6"/>Ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, mena ɛ́ tɔ mezuk ɔɔ, ye ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, bi neebela mɛghaaz nɛ tsik. Ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, mena eebelaka mɛghaaz ɔɔ, ye ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb needjɛ bin mɛghaaz. Mɛghaaz mɛ tak ɛ waadjɛ bin ghwyil ɛmaad membi mɛ mezuk bi di ebee ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7"/>É di'enek, bis ɛ́ nɛ boo ɛbwaalel nɛ nen. Etɛɛ náá, bis nɛ gu náá, dáa bi di ezuk mbi mezuk mɛ wat nɛ nes ɛ, bi ɛ́ waabela mbi mɛghaaz mɛ zedjɛaa bis ɛ.<verse eid="2CO 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg, bis kwyɛl ɛ́ náá, bi gu mbi mezuk mɛ bis nabee tɔ eghaada kyee dik Azi ɛ. Ye ɛ́ penek ɛ bis naboma nɛ mezuk dhaa nyel. Ye ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, bis nabɛ ɛ́ ààkabɛ nɛ ɛbwaalel náá, bis ɛ́ waatsak. <verse eid="2CO 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9"/>Deenek, bis nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ egeka náá, bis naazemyaal feŋ e ɛsyee. Ye nasael deenek ɛ etɛɛ náá, bis needi ààwa ɛbwaalel kɔ mɛnyel mes met. Tin, ye goka ɛ́ bis wa ɛbwaalel ɛ les nɛ Zɛɛb, mot di gomal bot ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10"/>Ye ɛ́ nyɛ ɛ́ napɛk bis tɔ mbi yenek ɛsyee, nyɛ ɛ́ kwaabaazopɛk bis. Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, bis ɛ́ nɛ ɛbwaalel nɛ nɛ náá, nyɛ waabaapɛk bis. <verse eid="2CO 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11"/>Tin, biyɔ pe, bi nɛ kwyee bis é sok bi di edjaala Zɛɛb étɛp'es ɛ. Étɛp tak ɛ, bɛtɛ nɛ bot di ebulal bhɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu mɛpɛka mɛ nyɛ napɛk bis tɔ ɛsyee, nɛ dáa nyɛ di eyala nɛ mendjaala mɔɔ étɛp'es ɛ.<verse eid="2CO 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl eepetaŋal dum nɛ mɛdjoŋ nyɛ di esa ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12"/>Gwakeka sa bis di egoka nɛ ɛghɛɛ nyel nɛ ye ɛ́. Esimsa bis ɛpelyaal bis popoopwon náá, bis eekɛ ɛnyɔɛpe tɔ epiki sama nɛ bot djas, daŋ-daŋ ɛ́ nɛ biyɔ. Tin, ye ɛ́ Zɛɛb ɛ́ djɛ bis ghwyil ɛsa etɛp binek djas. Ye ɛ́ bɛ bis naakɛ deenek ɔɔ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ etsoŋ ɛ bot ɛ bɔs. Tin, bis nakɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="2CO 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13"/>Tin, tɔ bɛmɛkana mes, bis kwyal bin ɛ́, sa di náá bi ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil laa nɛ ɛtiibal ɛ. Deenek, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ɛbwaalel náá, bi ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil tiibal etɛp djas bis di elii ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14"/>Ye ɛ́ koodi náá, nenak bi ààpatiibal etɛp djas di kwyala tɔ bɛmɛkana mes ɔɔ. Bis kwyɛl ɛ́ náá, bi tiibal yɛ. Deenek, dwoo ɛzyɛ ɛ́ Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu, bi ɛ́ waabi bet kɔ ɛsu ɛ les, dáa bisɔ pe ɛ́ aabi bet kɔ ɛsu ɛ len.<verse eid="2CO 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15"/>Eghɛŋ mɛ nake sok náá, mɛ ɛpezyɛ pɛ daa len ɛ, mɛ nadi ɛ́ ɛbwaalel náá egeka bin ɛ deenek. Mɛ nakwyɛl ɛ náá, mɛdjoŋ mam pɛ daa len sael tyee é sok ebá. <verse eid="2CO 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16"/>Deenek, mɛ nadi ekwyɛl náá, mɛ dhaa pɛ daa len, da mɛ ɛ́ goola tɔ́ pɛ kyee dik Masedwan. É mɛbhula, mɛ ɛ́ baadhaa pɛ daa len etɛɛ náá, bi neekwyee mɛ nɛ ɛgoola mɛndjoŋ mam pɛ kyee dik Yude. <verse eid="2CO 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17"/>Eghɛŋ mɛ nagek deenek ɛ, mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ mɛ nadjaa nɛ tsuŋ djem nɛ byak. Egeka ee mɛ nadi egek ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ ààdi tyee wat dáa bot ɛ bɔs'ak di ekɛ ɛ. Tin, bot binɔk ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil myaal «Iyoo» ghuna bɛ byen tep'enek byena.<verse eid="2CO 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18"/>Zɛɛb ɛ́ tyaases'am, sa mɛ di elɛɛ bin ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ étɛp ɛmyaal «Iyoo» edi wɔ byen sonok. <verse eid="2CO 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19"/>Etɛɛ náá, Yezu Klisto mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb, ee mam nɛ Silas zɛnɔɔ Timote, zegoola bin ɛ. Bhaadal tak nabɛ ɛ́ ààdi étɛp bot ɛmyaal «Iyoo» edi di náá wɔ eebyen «ààbɛ» ɔ. Bhaadal'es dum nɛ nɛ, nazobɛ ɛ́ «Iyoo». <verse eid="2CO 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20"/>Tin, Yezu ɛ́ di «Iyoo» kɔ etɛp djas Zɛɛb nakɛk ɛ. Ye ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, kɔ ɛsu ɛ Yezu Klisto ekɛk e Zɛɛb djas di «Iyoo». Ye ɛ́ bis di egoka nɛ ɛmyaal náá, «ye di deenek», étɛp ɛdjɛ duma nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="2CO 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21"/>Deenek, Zɛɛb nyɛ ɛmet ɛ́ di edjɛ bis nɛ biyɔ ghwyil ɛdi tɔ epiki tɔ ɛgwakel ɛ les nɛ Klisto. Ye ɛ́ Zɛɛb nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet ɛ́ sɛ́ɛ bis, étɛp bis needi bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ. <verse eid="2CO 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22"/>Deenek, nyɛ eezewa bis ndem nɛ din ɛ lɛ. Nyɛ eebaawa tɔ ebhum lyem bis Sisim na Dɛɛ, étɛp ɛlyaal náá, nyɛ aadjɛ bis sa nyɛ nakɛk mena ɛ.<verse eid="2CO 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23"/>Tin, mɛ eenɔɔ Zɛɛb dáa tyaases'am, mɛ kɔɔ ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ gó mɛ. Ye ɛ́ étɛp ɛkaab náá, mɛ ɛzɛkɛbaazamal bin ɛ, mɛ myaal náá, mɛ aanàkabaasik pɛ ghaada Koolɛt. <verse eid="2CO 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24"/>Deenek, bis ààsaa náá, bi myaal sa bis di elɛɛ bin ɛ nɛ bhel. Etɛɛ náá, bi ɛ́ ghiŋ tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. Bis saŋ ɛ́ náá, mena saka mɛsa é di wat étɛp mɛnyɔ men.<verse eid="2CO 1:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1"/>Étɛp tak ɛ, mɛ ke náá, mɛ tok baasik pɛ daa len, etɛɛ náá, mɛ ɛ́ zɛkɛbaazɛbaal elyem bin. <verse eid="2CO 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2"/>Mɛ baal bin elyem ɔɔ, ye tokapɛ nɛ dhiiti mot pak'en aakabaasa náá, lyem'am di tɔ mɛmyaala. Etɛɛ náá, biyɔ djas aakadi ɛ́ nɛ mɛbuk tɔ elyem. <verse eid="2CO 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3"/>Mɛ kwyal bin mɛkana mak dáak ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, mɛ zyɛ pɛ yebɔ ɔɔ, mɛ ɛzɛkɛdi nɛ ɛbuk tɔ lyem, dum nɛ bot ɛ waasa náá, mɛ di tɔ myaala ɔ. Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ nɛ gu náá, é ghɛŋ mɛ di tɔ myaala ɛ, biyɔ djas pe nɛ myaala. <verse eid="2CO 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4"/>Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ nakwyal bin mɛkana mak ɛ tɔ mɛnyaad, nɛ ɛbuk tɔ lyem, nɛ miŋal é mis. Ye bɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ étɛp ye needjɛ bin ghoŋ. Ye ɛ́ étɛp bi neegu náá, mɛ nɛ kwyɛl bin dhaa tyɛ.<verse eid="2CO 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl eepel mot lee nyɛ ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5"/>Tin, yɛ bɛ náá dhiiti mot ngɔt pak'en ɛsa náá, bi di nɛ ɛbuk ɔɔ, nyɛ ààpasa yɛ nɛ mam ɛmet, nyɛ sa ye ɛ́ nɛ biyɔ djas. Bela náá, mɛ ààpake deenek étɛp ɛbek tɛp. Etɛɛ náá, sa nyɛ sa ɛ ye eedyeebakpaa bɛdhiiti bot tɔ elyem. Tin, ye ɛ́ kabɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɔ, ye kpaa bɛ ɛ ba bim. <verse eid="2CO 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6"/>Étɛp mbi mot deenek, mɛdjamela mɛ bot ɛ zɛɛga edjala nɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2CO 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7"/>Dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ́ di náá, ye goka ɛ́ bi pel nyɛ. Deenek, da bi ɛ́ djɛ nyɛ mɛghaaz étɛp ɛkaab náá, syen ɛzɛkɛsa náá, ɛbwaalel nyɛ di nɛ ye ɛ́ si. <verse eid="2CO 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8"/>Tin, ngwyeebel'am pɛ daa len ɛ náá, lyaalka nyɛ náá, bi nɛ kwyɛl nyɛ. <verse eid="2CO 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9"/>Gwakeka sa nasa náá, mɛ kwyal bin mɛkana ɛ. Mɛ nasuu ɛ́ náá, mɛ wa bin tɔ mɛbhowal, étɛp mɛ neegu yɛ bɛ náá, bi nɛ looba nɛ mɛtiŋ mam ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10"/>Bi ɛ́ pel mot ɔɔ, mam pe ɛ́ waapel nyɛ. Tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ eepel mot'enɔk tɛp'enek. Nyɛ sa mɛ mbee tɛp ɔɔ, mɛ eepel nyɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ len. Mɛ sa ye ɛ́ é mis mɛ Klisto. <verse eid="2CO 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11"/>Etɛɛ náá, Satan needi ààkwak mena, deenek, menabɛlka djas nɛ gu egeka bɛ ɛnyɔɛpe.<verse eid="2CO 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl pɛ kyee dik Tɔlɔas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12"/>É sok mɛ nakum pɛ kyee dik Toloas, étɛp ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Klisto ɛ, mɛ naabee náá, Ghɛŋ naadii mɛ ze étɛp mɛ sa mɛsa. <verse eid="2CO 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13"/>Tin, kɛŋ naazɛsa mɛ tɔ lyem dhaa tyɛ, etɛɛ náá mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbela mɔn nyɛɛg'ena Tit. Étɛp tak ɛ mɛ namwana nɛ bot ɛ Tɔlɔas. Wɔ gwak, mɛ zɛgoola tɔ́ pɛ kyee dik Masedwan.<verse eid="2CO 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu Klisto nɛ djɛ eghɛŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14"/>Duu nɛ Zɛɛb, etɛɛ náá nyɛ ɛ́ di nɛ ghwyil kɔ etɛp djas. Ye ɛ́ nyɛ ɛ́ di edjɛɛd lɔɔg bot ɛ di ekɛ tɔ mɛmyaala ɔ, étɛp mena gheedidika bɛghɛŋ e mɛwala djas kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛgwakel ɛ lena nɛ Klisto. Deenek, kɔ ɛsu ɛlena, nyɛ eesa náá, bot gu Klisto dáa mɛnuub mɛ mbɛɛ mɛmanas zesoaa é edi djas ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15"/>Tin, menaka ɛ́ dáa mɛnanas na mbɛɛ mɛnuub ɛ Klisto. Ye ɛ́ mɛnuub mɛ buwa nyɛ naka Zɛɛb ye ɛ́. Mɛnuub mɛ mɛnanas tak ɛpetɔ́ pɛ daa bot ɛ zebela tsik ɔ, nɛ pɛ daa bot ɛ zewo ze ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16"/>Étɛp bot zewo ze ɔ, ye ɛ́ nuub ɛ mbee mɛnuub mɛ myoŋ. Ye kabɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɔ, ye ɛ́ nuub ɛ mbɛɛ mɛnuub mɛ tsik. Tin, ɛzɛ di nɛ ghwyil ɛsa yenek mbi mɛsa? <verse eid="2CO 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17"/>Bisɔ tok dáa bɛdhiiti bot ɛ di ebɔmsa mɛkpa mɛ Zɛɛb ɔ. Etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ lwom bis. Tin, bis goola mɛkpa mɛ ɛ, tɔ etsɛɛtsɛ é mis mɛ, etɛɛ náá, bis ɛ́ bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ Klisto.<verse eid="2CO 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3"/>
  <para style="s">Bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ ɛbhɛŋ ɛ na bes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1"/>Tin, bi gek belak ɛ náá, bis kwyɛl ɛpelyaal bin sa bis di ɛ? Nɛghu bot aadi ɛ́ nɛ gwyes ɛtel bin mɛkana mɛ di elyaal náá, bis ɛ́ bɛtɛtɛ bot ɛ lwoma? Nɛghu bis waab nɛ nen náá, bi kwyal bis mɛkana mɛ tak e? <verse eid="2CO 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2"/>Deenek, biyɔ bɛmet ɛ́ di mɛkana mes zekwyalaa tɔ ebhum elyem bis ɛ. Tin, bot djas ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛgu nɛ ɛlaa. <verse eid="2CO 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3"/>Tsɛɛtsɛ, ye ɛ́ popoopwon náá, bi ɛ́ mɛkana ɛ Klisto nazekwyal da bis ɛzyɛ nɛ ye ɛ́. Tin, mɛkana mɛ tak ààpakwyalaa nɛ kwos, ye nakwyalaa ɛ nɛ Sisim Zɛɛb di nɛ tsik ɛ. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ ààkwyalaa kɔ ɛkok dáa etsi ɛ Moiiz nakwyalaa ɛ. Tin, ye nakwyalaa ɛ́ tɔ ebhum elyem bot.<verse eid="2CO 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4"/>Bot lii deenek ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛbwaalel ee bot di nɛ yɛ nɛ Zɛɛb dum nɛ Klisto ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5"/>Bis tok nɛ egeka náá, bis ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛsa mɛsa menek bisɔ bɛmet. Tin, Zɛɛb ɛ́ di edjɛ bis ghwyil ɛsa sa bis di egoka nɛ ɛsa ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6"/>Ye ɛ́ nyɛy ɛ́ nasa náá, mena dika bot ɛ mɛsa tɔ ɛbhɛŋ ɛ lɛ na bes. Ɛbhɛŋ ɛ tak ààbela ɛsuk tɔ etsi, ye bela ɛsuk ɛ tɔ Sisim. Etɛɛ náá, tsi dul bot ɛ tɔ ɛsyee, yɛ kabɛ Sisim ɔ, ye djɛ bot ɛ tsik.<verse eid="2CO 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7"/>Etsi nakwyalaa ɛ́ kɔ mɛkok, deenek, duma ɛ Ghɛŋ naanyen é ɛwala ɛlenek. Bhwoob ɛ Moiiz nadi ekas kɔkɔ mbi mɛkas mɛ wat di náá, bot ɛ Yisalaɛl nabɛ ɛ́ ààbela ghwyil ɛdhonal mis kɔ lɛ, étɛp ɛbee nyɛ. Tin, mɛkas mɛ tak nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɔya. Mɛsa mɛ etsi tak dul bot ɛ tɔ ɛsyee. Eghɛŋ mɛsa mɛ di edul bot tɔ ɛsyee natuula ɛ, ye naalyaal bot náá, duma Zɛɛb ɛ nɛ boo mɛkas. <verse eid="2CO 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8"/>Ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, mɛkas mɛ sok nadi ɛ́ deenek ɔɔ, «haa» mɛkas mɛ duma e mɛsa mɛ Sisim aakadi dáa? <verse eid="2CO 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9"/>Ye ɛ́ bɛ náá mɛsa mɛ etsi di ewa bot tɔ feŋ, ɛpelyaal boo mɛkas ɔɔ. Tin, mɛsa mɛ Sisim di esa náá, bot di piki é mis mɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, aadi ɛ́ nɛ mɛkas dhaa-dhaŋak. <verse eid="2CO 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10"/>Tin, bot ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛke náá, duma nadi ekas sok ɛ, ye tokapɛ vaŋ sonok é mis mɛ duma di ekas tɔ mɛlu mak ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, mɛkas mɛ duma di mos ɛ, ye eedhaa-dhaŋak yii sok. <verse eid="2CO 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11"/>Ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, sa di náá ye ààbɔya naadi ɛ́ nɛ duma ɔɔ, «haa» gwyata nɛ sa di náá, ye ɛ́ kɔm-kɔm ɛ!<verse eid="2CO 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12"/>Dáa ye di náá, bis ɛ́ nɛ mbi mɛbun mak ɛ, bis tokapɛ nɛ bwoo tɔ lyem. <verse eid="2CO 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13"/>Menabɛl ààsaka dáa Moiiz, mot nadi ebutal bhwoob'ɛ nɛ bhɛɛ. Nyɛ nasa deenek ɛ, etɛɛ náá, bɔn Yisalaɛl needi ààbee dáa mɛkas menek nadi etɔ́ nɛ ɛdiib ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14"/>Tin, kɛkum e dwoo ɛlak mos, mɛtselal ɛ lɔɔ nabɛ ɛ́ àànyɔ ɛmɛt ɛsuk ɛ tak. Etɛɛ náá, mis mɛ bɔn ɛ Yisalaɛl nadi ɛ́ nɛ edim é ghɛŋ bɛ nadi elaa bɛmɛkana mɛ ɛbhɛŋ bɛ na mwa ɛ. Tin, bhɛɛ tak aazodus bɛ é mis mɛ sok bhwoob mɛkas ɛ Klisto, mot di nɛ ghwyil ɛdis bɛ ye ɛ́. <verse eid="2CO 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15"/>Dɔɔ nɛ dwoo pan mos'ak, é ghɛŋ bɛ aadi elaa-laa bɛmɛkana ɛ Moiiz ɛ, ye ɛ́ nɛ bhɛɛ wat di ebutal mɛtselal mɔɔ. <verse eid="2CO 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16"/>Ekwyala elɛɛ ɛ́ náá: «Moiiz nadis-dis bhɛɛ é bhwoob ɛ, é ghɛŋ nyɛ nadi eliig mis gwyák Ghɛŋ ɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:34">Ɛwy 34.34</ref>.</char></note>.» <verse eid="2CO 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17"/>Tin, Ghɛŋ ɛ́ Sisim. Deenek, edi Sisim ɛ Ghɛŋ di ɔ, mot tok si bhel etsi. <verse eid="2CO 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18"/>Tin, menabɛlka djas tokeka nɛ mɛbhwoob e mbutela, mena lyaalka ɛ mɛkas ɛ Ghɛŋ, mena eeswolaka étɛp ɛnɔŋel nɛ Ghɛŋ. Nenak, duma mena belaka ɛpebyet ɛbyet nɛ ɛbyet. Duma tak dus ɛ́ pɛ daa Ghɛŋ, nyɛ ɛ́ mot di Sisim ɔ.<verse eid="2CO 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4"/>
  <para style="s">Ekum tɔ bhe dyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1"/>Zɛɛb tɔ enɛm esa bɛ, naadjɛ mena mɛsa mak. Tin, dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ́ di náá, ye ɛ́ ààgoka náá, mena bula pɛ bhis. <verse eid="2CO 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2"/>Bis eelum koŋ nɛ embee etɛp di esael tɔ sɔ ɛ, etɛp di edjɛ syen ɛ. Bis ààsa mɛkɔŋ, bis ààswola mɛkpa mɛ Zɛɛb. Tin, ye bisɔ di elyaal popoopwon ɛ́ etsɛɛtsɛ, ɛkwosak ɛ les ɛ́ náá, elyem bot djas gu náá, ye bisɔ di elyo bot ɛ ye ɛ́ etsɛɛtsɛ é mis mɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="2CO 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3"/>Ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, Mbɛɛ Bhaadal bis di egoola ɛ, ye ɛ́ syela ɔ, deenek, ye ɛ́ aazodi ɛ́ syela étɛp bot ɛ di ewo ze ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4"/>Ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, ye ɛ́ nɛ bot ɛ di ààdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb di tɔ gwoo ɔɔ, ye ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, Satan mbee zɛɛb di si ɔ, nyɛ eezedipal mɛtselal mɔɔ. Nyɛ ɛpesa náá, bɛ nàbee mɛkas mɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal nɛghu duma ɛ Klisto. Nyɛy mot di mbaŋa-mbaŋa Zɛɛb ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5"/>Bis ààgoola wak Mbɛɛ Bhaadal mɛ mɛnyel mes, bis goola wak ɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu Klisto. Yɛ kabɛ bisɔ ɔ, bis ɛ́ bɛkwom ɛ mɛsa men kɔ ɛsu ɛ Yezu. <verse eid="2CO 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6"/>Eghɛŋ sok, Zɛɛb nalɛɛ ɛ́ náá: «Beta náá mɛkas djɛ gwyɛ tɔ ghooghom<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:3">Mɛk 1.3</ref>.</char></note>!» Nyɛ nasa deenek ɛ etɛɛ náá, nyɛ di edjɛ mɛkas tɔ bhum elyem bena, étɛp mena neesiizaka duma Zɛɛb di ekas kɔ bhwoob ɛ Klisto ɛ.<verse eid="2CO 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7"/>Tin, menabɛlka bot ɛ di nɛ ekum e tak ɔ, mena bepka ye ɛ́ tɔ mɛbhe mɛ dyak. Mena saka deenek ɛ, étɛp ɛlyaal náá, boo mɛbwala mɛ tak dus ɛ́ pɛ daa Zɛɛb, ààkabɛ náá, ye dus ɛ́ pɛ daa les. <verse eid="2CO 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8"/>Tin, bis naasusaa mbee mɛsusa, bis nabɛ ɛ́ ààtsak pɛ yesɔ kyee; bis nadi edjɛ lyem mɛbɛ, bis nadi ɛ́ nɛ ɛbwaalel; <verse eid="2CO 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9"/>bis natiigaa, Zɛɛb nabɛ ɛ́ ààduugal bis; bis naadumaa si, bis nabɛ ɛ́ ààgwyɛ. <verse eid="2CO 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10"/>Tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛlu djas, bis nadi ebɛp-bɛp mezuk mɛ ɛsyee ɛ Yezu tɔ mɛnyel mes. Etɛɛ náá, tsik ɛ Yezu neenyen tɔ mɛnyel mes. <verse eid="2CO 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11"/>Ye nakoozodi náá bis ɛ́ nɛ tsik, bot ɛpewun ɛgó bis kɔ ɛsu ɛ Yezu, etɛɛ náá, tsik ɛ Yezu neenyen tɔ mɛnyel mes. Mɛnyel mɛ di náá, yɛ waaboogwyɛ ɛ́. <verse eid="2CO 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12"/>Ye ɛ́ deenek ɛ ɛsyee di esa mɛsa mɛ tɔ les, etɛɛ náá, tsik neesa mɛsa tɔ len.<verse eid="2CO 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13"/>Tin, ekwyala lɛɛ ɛ́ náá: «Mɛ eedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, ye ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ mɛ di elii<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 116:10">Mɛd 116.10</ref>.</char></note>.» Dɔɔ nɛ bisɔ pe, bis eedum nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, étɛp tak bis di elii. <verse eid="2CO 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14"/>Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, bis nɛ gu náá, Zɛɛb mot nagomal Ghɛŋ Yezu tɔ ɛsyee ɔ, nyɛ waagomal bis nɛ biyɔ pe. Bhii tak, nyɛ aatɔ́ nɛ nena edi nyɛ di ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15"/>É di'enek, mezuk djas ee bis di eboma nɛ yɛ'aak, ye ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ len. Ye ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, bɛtɛ nɛ bot neebela enɛm nɛ embɛɛ e Zɛɛb. Deenek, bɛtɛ nɛ bot ɛ́ waabulal bhɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb dhaa tyɛ, nɛ ɛduwal nyɛ.<verse eid="2CO 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Duma di ezyɛ ɛ́, ye aadi ɛ́ kɔm-kɔm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16"/>Dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ́ bis di ààbula pɛ bhis. Ye nakoozodi náá, mɛnyel mes ɛpetɔ́ nɛ ɛsila batsa-batsa. Tin, Zɛɛb ɛpedjɛ esisim bis mɛghaaz mɛlu djas. <verse eid="2CO 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17"/>Deenek, bɔn mezuk mɛ bis di emaad é ba mɔn ɛwala ɛlak'aak, aabodi ɛ́ si. Bis ɛ́ waabela boo duma kɔ ɛsu ɛ mezuk mɛ tak. Duma tak ɛ waadhaa esonok djas, yɛ aadi ɛ́ kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm. Eghɛŋ bis di etaala duma bot aabela ɛ, mezuk menek tok dhiiti vaŋ sonok. <verse eid="2CO 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18"/>Etɛɛ náá, bis ààdyeebawa esiiza ɛ́ kɔ esa di beeaa nɛ mis ɛ. Bisɔ kwyɛl ɛ́ esa ee bot di ààbee nɛ mis ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, esa di ebeeaa nɛ mis ɛ, yɛ ààdi kɔm-kɔm. Tin, esa di kɔm-kɔm ɛ́, ye ɛ́ esa ee bot di ààbeeaa nɛ mis ɛ.<verse eid="2CO 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5"/>
  <para style="s">Ndjaa Zɛɛb zekoobal mena yɛ pɛ tɔ gwoo ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1"/>Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ mena nɛ guka náá, mɛnyel mɛ mena di nɛ yɛ kɔ bɔs'ak aanàdi kɔm-kɔm. Ye ɛ́ dáa bɔn epɛt, yɛ ààbɔya nɛ ɛbik. Ye ɛ́ bik ɔɔ, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waadjɛ mena dhiiti mendjaa pɛ tɔ gwoo. Mendjaa mɛ na kɔm-kɔm tak, tok zumal mɛmbɔ mɛ bot. <verse eid="2CO 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2"/>Nenak, tɔ epet binek, mena ɛpesimka etɛɛ náá, ɛkwosak ɛ lena ɛ náá, mena neetɔ́ka kɛsyel mɛnyel tɔ mendjaa di pɛ tɔ gwoo ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3"/>Mena ɛ́ syel mɛnyel mena deenek ɔɔ, mena aanàkabaadika mɛnyel toto. <verse eid="2CO 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4"/>É di'enek, dáa ye di náá, mena dinaaka ɛ́ tɔ epɛt bak kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs'ak ɛ, mena aazodi ɛ́ esim ɛkɛɛ mot ɛpezuk nɛ mɛdil mɛ kɔm. Ye ààkwyɛl ɛlyaal náá, mena ɛpekwyɛl ɛbɛkaka nɛ mɛnyel mɛ bot di nɛ yɛ'aak. Tin, ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ náá, mena ɛkwyɛl ɛsyel ɛ mɛnyel mes pɛ tɔ mendjaa di pɛ tɔ gwoo ɛ, etɛɛ náá, tsik neenɔɔ di ɛsyee. <verse eid="2CO 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5"/>Ye ɛ́ Zɛɛb, nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet ɛ́ zekoobal mena étɛp ɛdi tɔ tsik tak. Nyɛ naleedjɛ mena sok ɛkɛɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ, étɛp ɛlyaal náá, nyɛ waadjɛ mena dhiiti esonok sis.<verse eid="2CO 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6"/>Deenek, menaka mɛlu djas ɛ́ nɛ mɛghaaz. Mena nɛ guka náá, é ghɛŋ mena dika nɛ nyel'ak ɛ, menaka ɛ́ ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ Ghɛŋ. <verse eid="2CO 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7"/>Tin, mena kɛka ɛ́ tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, ààkabɛ-bɛak kɔ esa ee mena di ebee ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8"/>Menaka ɛ́ nɛ mɛghaaz. Tin, ɛkwosak ɛ lena ɛ́ náá, mena betka mɛnyel mɛ bɔs'ak étɛp ɛkɛdi sama nɛ Ghɛŋ. <verse eid="2CO 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9"/>Tin, ɛkwosak ɛ lena yii mɛkɛn ɛ́ náá, nyɛ myaala nɛ nena. Ye ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ dáa mena dika nɛ tsik, nɛghu ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, mena eezegwyɛ ɔɔ. <verse eid="2CO 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10"/>Etɛɛ náá, menabɛlka djas ɛ́ waadika sok bhwoob ɛ Klisto, étɛp nyɛ neepɛ́ɛ mena. Tin, mot nɛ mot aabela yɛ efute dum nɛ mbɛɛ mɛsa nɛghu mbee mɛsa mɛ nyɛ nasa kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɛ.<verse eid="2CO 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kɔ ɛsu ɛ Klisto, Zɛɛb eebulal ɛgwakel nɛ bot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11"/>Mena nɛ guka sa ɛlooba nɛ Ghɛŋ di ekwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ, dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ mena di esaa náá, bot ɛ bɔs dum koŋ nɛ nɛ. Deenek, Zɛɛb nɛ gu mena ɛnyɔɛpe, mɛ nɛ gu náá, biyɔ pe, bi nɛ baagu bis ɛnyɔɛpe tɔ ebhum elyem bin. <verse eid="2CO 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12"/>Bi ɛ nɛ egeka náá, bis ɛpekwyɛl baalyaal bin sa bis di ɛ, lyaala sis e? Ɛzɛ djɛ bis ghwyil ɛsa mɛsa mak? Ààbɛ, bis ààpakwyɛl ɛlyaal bin sa bis di ɛ. Tin, bis baŋa bin ɛ́, sa bi di egoka nɛ ɛdi nɛ edjɔɔ é mis «pya» kɔ ɛsu ɛ les ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, é ghɛŋ bot aalii ɛbiyoɛpe nɛ nes ɛ, bi neegu dáa bi aayala bɛ ɛ. Bɔɔ ghɛɛ mɛnyel ɛ nɛ etɛp epuud, bɛ ààbee ebhum elyem bɔɔ. <verse eid="2CO 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13"/>Ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, bis ɛpelyet ɔɔ, ye ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ Zɛɛb. Ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, bis ɛ́ nɛ tɛtɛ esiiza ɔɔ, ye ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ len. <verse eid="2CO 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14"/>É di'enek, kwyɛl ɛ Klisto ɛ́ tɔ elyem bena. Kwyɛl'enek ɛpesa mena emyaalka náá, mot ngɔt naagwyɛ étɛp bot djas ɔ. Deenek, menabɛlka djas pe eezegwyɛ sama nɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2CO 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15"/>Ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, nyɛ nagwyɛ ɛ́ étɛp bot djas ɔɔ. Bot ɛ di nɛ tsik ɔ, tokapɛ nɛ tsik étɛp'ɔɔ ɛmet. Tin, bɛ nɛ tsik ɛ, kɔ ɛsu ɛ mot nagwyɛ da gom étɛp'ɔɔ ɛ.<verse eid="2CO 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16"/>Étɛp tak ɛ dinaa, bis aanàbaabee mot nɛ mis mɛ epuud. Ye nakoozodi náá, é ghɛŋ sok, bis naabee Klisto deenek ɔɔ. Nenak, bis ààkabee nyɛ deenek. <verse eid="2CO 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17"/>Mot ɛ di tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Klisto ɔɔ, mot yenɔk moo ɛ́ mot na bes. Mɛfulu mɛ na mwa eesi tɔ lɛ, nyɛ moo ɛ́ tɔ mɛfulu mɛ na bes. <verse eid="2CO 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18"/>Etɛp binek djas dus ɛ́ pɛ daa Zɛɛb. Ye ɛ́ nyɛy mot nadhis Klisto étɛp ɛbulal ɛgwakel pak mena nɛ nɛ ɔ. Bhii tak, nyɛ naadjɛ mena mɛsa mɛ ɛkɛgoola bhaadal ɛbulal ɛgwakel nɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2CO 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19"/>Zɛɛb nadhis Klisto ɛ́ étɛp ɛbulal ɛgwakel pak bɛ nɛ bot ɛ bɔs. Nyɛ nasa deenek ɛ, étɛp nyɛ needi ààbaadi esiiza mesyem mɛ bot. Nyɛ eekwyeed mena étɛp ɛkɛgoola bhaadal ɛbulal ɛgwakel nɛ nɛ.<verse eid="2CO 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20"/>Bis moo ɛ́ engoola-ngoola ɛ Klisto. Zɛɛb nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet ɛ di edjóo bin tɔ mɛkpa mɛ bis di egoola bin ɛ. Bis ɛpedjaala nɛ nen nɛ din ɛ Klisto náá: «Myaalka ɛbulal ɛgwakel nɛ Zɛɛb.» <verse eid="2CO 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21"/>Klisto nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ mesyem. Tin, Zɛɛb naanɔɔ mesyem mena djɛ nyɛ. Zɛɛb nasa deenek ɛ, etɛɛ náá, mena needika bot ɛ epiki é mis mɛ.<verse eid="2CO 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1"/>Deenek, dáa bis di esa mɛsa sama nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, bis ɛpedjaala nɛ nen: «Nàsaka náá, enɛm nɛ embɛɛ e Zɛɛb djɛ bin ɛ, ye gwyɛ tɔ toto.» <verse eid="2CO 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2"/>É di'enek, Zɛɛb ke ɛ́ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">«Eghɛŋ ɛwala tak aakum ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">mɛ naagwak mendjaala mɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">é dwoo tsik, mɛ naazyɛ zɛtsik wɔ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:8">Eza 49.8</ref>.</char></note>.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">Nenak, myaalka náá, ɛwala tak eezekum, ye ɛ́ dwoo di náá, Zɛɛb aatsik bot ɛ.<verse eid="2CO 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dáa mot di egoka nɛ ɛdi sosoob nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3"/>Bis ààkwyɛl náá, mot lii ɛbiyoɛpe dum nɛ mɛsa mes. Ye ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ di náá, bis ààpakwyɛl ɛdi ɛbɛk ɛ mot, ye nakoozodi dáa. <verse eid="2CO 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4"/>Bela náá, bis ɛpesa etɛp djas di egoka, étɛp bi neemyaal náá, bis ɛ́ bɛtɛtɛ bot mɛsa ɛ Zɛɛb. Ye ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ, bis di emaad mezuk, nɛ mɛtiiga zɛnɔɔ epwom. <verse eid="2CO 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5"/>Bɛ naabi bis, wa bis é membok, bɛ naaful mɛdhuu mɛ bot lo. Bis naasa mɛsa mɛ na lyel-lyel. Bis naapaal tɔ pum. Bis naamaad za. <verse eid="2CO 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6"/>Bis ɛpelyaal náá, bis ɛ́ bot ɛ mɛsa ɛ Zɛɛb: tɔ epiki, tɔ ɛgu, tɔ ɛdil ɛ lyem, tɔ enɛm esa, tɔ ghwyil Sisim na Dɛɛ, nɛ tɔ tɛtɛ kwyɛl di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ sis ɛ, <verse eid="2CO 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7"/>tɔ ɛgoola mɛkpa mɛ etsɛɛtsɛ, tɔ mɛbwala mɛ Zɛɛb. Tɔ mbɔ é ghɛŋ'es bis nadi ɛ́ nɛ pɛl, tɔ mbɔ e myɛl kadi ɛ́ sa bis di peebal nyel nɛ ye ɛ́. Ye ɛ́ deenek ɛ, bis di di ekɛ tɔ epiki. <verse eid="2CO 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8"/>Bɛdhiiti bot ɛpedjɛ bis duu; bak bot kabee bis é mis ɛ́ toto. Bɛdhiiti bot ɛpeduwal bis; bak bɛdhiiti ɛpelee bis. Bɛ ke ɛ́ náá, bis ɛ́ bot ɛ etsal, ghuna bis lɛɛ ɛ́ etɛp etsɛɛtsɛ. <verse eid="2CO 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9"/>Bɛdhiti bot bee bis ɛ́ náá, bis ààval sonok; bela náá, bɛdhiiti bot nɛ gu bis. Eghɛŋ bɛ di ebee bis ɛ, bɛ bee bis ɛ dáa bot di náá, bis eezedjɛaa feŋ ɛsyee; deenek, bis ɛ́ nɛ tsik. Bɛ ɛpewa bis tɔ tsik mezuk; deenek, bis ààgwyɛ. <verse eid="2CO 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10"/>Bɛ ɛpesa náá, elyem bis kpaa; bis ɛ́ tɔ mɛmyaala. Bis ɛ́ bɛdjel ɛ bot; bela náá, bis ɛpedjɛ mɛvu nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ bot. Ye di ɛkɛɛ bis ɛ toto, ghuna nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, bis ɛ́ nɛ esonok djas.<verse eid="2CO 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11"/>Biyɔ, bɔɔ bɛsɔ bis bot ɛ Koolɛt, bis lii nɛ nen wak ɛ́ nɛ etsɛɛtsɛ, nɛ lyem wat. <verse eid="2CO 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12"/>Bis ààpabyen ɛkwyɛl bin, ye ɛ́ biyɔ ɛ́ di lyel elyem. <verse eid="2CO 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13"/>Tin, mɛ lii nɛ nen wak ɛ́, dáa mɛ di elii nɛ bɔn bam ɛ: lɛɛka bis sa di tɔ elyem bin ɛ, kwyɛlka bis nɛ lyem wat, dáa bis di ekwyɛl bin ɛ.<verse eid="2CO 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛbaka ɛkɛ nɛ bɛmbee ɛ bot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14"/>Sa bi ààkɛ lɔɔg nɛ bot ɛ di ààdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ. Tin, sa di tɔ epiki ɛ, ye ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛkɛ sama nɛ sa di ààdi tɔ epiki ɛ? Ghooghom nɛ mɛkas ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛkɛ lɔɔg e? <verse eid="2CO 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15"/>Klisto ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil gwakel bɛ nɛ Satan e? Mot di edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil di nɛ esiiza wat bɛ nɛ mot di ààdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ? <verse eid="2CO 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16"/>Yak mbi ɛgwakel aadi pak ndjaa Zɛɛb nɛ mendjaa bɛnaghisɛ, bot ɛ di ààdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ? Tin, menaka ɛ́ ndjaa Zɛɛb di nɛ tsik ɛ! Gwaka sa Zɛɛb nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet nalɛɛ ɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">«Mɛ aadidi ɛ́ bis nɛ bɛ nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">mɛ aagyee ɛ́ bis nɛ bɛ nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">mɛ aadi ɛ́ Zɛɛb ɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">bɔɔ kadi ɛ́ bot bam.»<verse eid="2CO 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17"/>Étɛp tak ɛ, Ghɛŋ di eke nɛ bot bɛ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">«Duska tɔ ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ di ààdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">bɛkaka nɛ nɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">Sa bi ààmɛt sa di nɛ edhuud ɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">Tin ɛ, mɛ aamyaal bin.<verse eid="2CO 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18"/>Mɛ aadi ɛ́ Sɛɛg'en,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:18">da bi ɛ́ di esɛŋɛlɛ bɔn bam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:18">Ghɛŋ mɛbwala ɛ́ di elii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">v. 16: <char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 26:12">Msa 26.12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:27">Ɛze 37.27</ref></char>v. 17: <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 52:11">Eza 52.11</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:34">Ɛze 20.34</ref></char>v. 18: <char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 7:14">Sm2 7.14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:6">Eza 43.6</ref></char></char></note>.»<verse eid="2CO 6:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg bam, Zɛɛb nakɛk esa binek djas ɛ́ étɛp'enaka. Étɛp tak, dhjoodiska edhuud é mɛnyel mena nɛghu tɔ elyem bena. Djhoosaka mɛghaaz mɛ ɛdi ɛ́ dɛɛ, é kaab ɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="2CO 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛmyaala ɛ Pɔl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2"/>Saka náá, bis bela di tɔ elyem bin. Bis ààpasa ɛbiyo nɛ mot, bis ààpazuk mot, bis ààpakɔɔ mot étɛp ɛnɔɔ sa yɛ. <verse eid="2CO 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3"/>Mɛ ààlii deenek étɛp ɛkwyesal bin ndjɛ sɔs. Tin, ye ɛ́ dáa mɛ ke sok ɛ́, bi ɛ́ tɔ elyem bis, ye nakoozodi ɛsyee nɛghu tsik, mena aazodika ɛ́ sama. <verse eid="2CO 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4"/>Mɛ ɛ́ nɛ boo ɛbwaalel nɛ nen. Mɛ nɛ dyeebamyaala nɛ nen. Mɛ ɛ́ nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ mɛghaaz, mɛmyaala ɛ́ tɔ lam «tɔɔ» ye nakoozodi náá, mena naazuka ɛbuɛpe.<verse eid="2CO 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5"/>É ɛkum ɛ les pɛ kyee dik Masedwan, bis nabɛ ɛ́ ààkoowala batsa, bis naazɛboma nɛ membi mɛ mezuk djas. Ye nakadi ɛ́ nɛ mɛwɔ pak bis nɛ bɛdhiiti bot, nɛ bwoo tɔ elyem bis. <verse eid="2CO 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6"/>Tin, Zɛɛb mot di edjɛ mɛghaaz nɛ bot ɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛghaaz ɔ, nyɛ naazɛdjɛ bis mɛghaaz, é sok Tit nakum ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7"/>Ye ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, ɛzyɛ ɛ́ Tit naadjɛ bis mɛghaaz, ye ɛ́ dɔɔ nɛ ɛbaŋa nyɛ baŋa bis dáa bi djɛ nyɛ mɛghaaz penek ɛ. Nyɛ eelɛɛ bis dáa bi di nɛ gwyes ɛbee mɛ ɛ. Nyɛ naabaalɛɛ bis dáa bi di edjɛ elyem bin mɛbɛ, dum nɛ mbee esesɛɛ bi nadi esesa sok ɛ. Nyɛ eebaalɛɛ bis zii bi di nɛ yɛ é ghɛŋ bi di ekɛm mɛ ɛ. Étɛp tak ɛ́ mɛ di nɛ mɛmyaala ɛbuɛpe. <verse eid="2CO 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8"/>Tin, yɛ bɛ náá, mɛkana mɛ mɛ nakyeed bin yɛ sok ɛ naakpaa bin elyem ɔɔ. Nenak yak, mɛ ààkadjɛ nyel'am mɛbɛ. Ye ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, ye mɛkɛn mɛ naadjɛ lyem'am mɛbɛ ɛ é ghɛŋ mɛ nagu náá, mɛkana mɛ tak naakpaa bin elyem. <verse eid="2CO 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9"/>Nenak, lyem'am ɛ́ tɔ mɛmyaala, ààbɛ etɛɛ náá, elyem bin naakpaa. Tin, mɛ myaala ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, ɛkpaa lyem nakpaa bin ɛ naaswoola bin mɛfulu. Deenek, ɛkpaa lyem tak nabɛ ɛ́ ɛkwosak ɛ Zɛɛb, étɛp bi needi ààtuŋ tɔ lyem kɔ ɛsu ɛ les. Nyɛ nasa deenek ɛ, étɛp bis needi ààbet bin bi di tɔ ɛbiyo. <verse eid="2CO 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10"/>Etɛɛ náá, ɛkpaa lyem di tɔ ɛkwosak ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ nɛ sa náá, mot swoola mɛfulu étɛp ɛbela tsik. Deenek ɛ mena waabela tsik ààdjɛ lyem mɛbɛ. Tin, ɛkpaa lyem di edus tɔ ɛsiiza etɛp e bɔs ɛ, ye djɛ ɛ́ ɛsyee. <verse eid="2CO 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11"/>Nenak yak, beeka sa ɛkpaa lyem bin di edus tɔ ɛkwosak ɛ Zɛɛb kadjɛ ɛ: «haa» ɛkwosak swola nɛ nen, «haa» boo zii tɔ etaŋal bin, «haa» bhyen mesyem tɔ len, «haa» bwoo tɔ len, «haa» boo gwyes ɛboma nɛ nam, «haa» mbi yenek zii nɛ bas ɛwa ɛbiyo é feŋ. Bi eelyaal popoopwon náá, bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ tɔ tɛp'enek.<verse eid="2CO 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12"/>Ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, mɛ naakwyal bin mɛkana ɔɔ, ye nabɛ ààbɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ mot nasa ɛbiyo ɔ, ààkobɛ-bɛak kɔ ɛsu ɛ mot bɛ nasa nyɛ ɛbiyo ɔ. Tin, ye nabɛ ɛ́, étɛp bi neebee popoopwon é mis mɛ Zɛɛb zii bi di nɛ yɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ les ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13"/>Étɛp tak ɛ mɛfulu men djɛ bis mɛghaaz.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Ye ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, bis naadyeebamyaala dum nɛ sa bi nasa ɛ. Tin, bis nabaabela boo mɛmyaala kɛdhaa, é sok bis nabee Tit tɔ mɛmyaala. Ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ tɔ mɛmyaala ɔɔ, ye ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, bi nadjɛ nyɛ mɛghaaz. <verse eid="2CO 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14"/>Tin, mɛ eedyeebaduwal bin é mis mɛ Tit. Bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààdjɛ mɛ syen. É di'enek, bis dyeebalɛɛ bin ɛ etɛp etsɛɛtsɛ. Ye ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ ɛduwal ɛ, mɛ nadi eduwal bin é mis mɛ Tit ɛ, nadi enyen popoopwon. <verse eid="2CO 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15"/>Deenek, nyɛ ɛpebaakwyɛl bin dhaa tyɛ, é ghɛŋ nyɛ di etaala nɛ ɛlooba ɛ len, nɛ dáa bi nabe nyɛ nɛ duu djas ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16"/>Mɛ ɛ́ nɛ mɛmyaala nɛ dáa mɛ di ewa ɛbwaalel ɛ lam nɛ nen tɔ etɛp djas ɛ.<verse eid="2CO 7:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8"/>
  <para style="s">Epata nakyeeda pɛ zɛɛga mendjaala mɛ ghaada Yeluzalɛm étɛp ɛkwyee bɛ ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg, ɛkwosak ɛ les ɛ́ náá, bi gu dáa Zɛɛb nasɛɛ bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala mɛ kyee dik Masedwan mɛtel ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2"/>Bɛ naaboma nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ mɛbhowal nasa náá, bɛ di tɔ bɛtɛ nɛ mezuk. Tin, bɛ nazodi ɛ́ tɔ mɛmyaala dhaa tyɛ. Ààbee edjel bɛ nadi nɛ yɛ dhaa tye ɛ́, boo mɛmyaala mɛ bɛ nadi nɛ ye ɛ́, naasa náá, bɛ djɛ bɛtɛ nɛ esonok. <verse eid="2CO 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3"/>Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ ɛ́ tyaasɛs, bɛ naadyeebadjɛ esa kɛdhaa-dhaŋa ekum bɔɔ, ààbɛ náá, mot naawaab. <verse eid="2CO 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4"/>Bɛ naadyeebadjaala nɛ nes étɛp bis neemyaal náá, bɛ sɛɛg yɔbɔ ɛtom étɛp ɛkyeed pɛ daa bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala di pɛ ghaada Yelusalɛm ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5"/>Bɛ naadyeebasa dhaa yii bis nadi ebwaal ɛ. Bɛ naadjɛ ebhum elyem bɔɔ djas, tɔ kwyɛl nɛ Ghɛŋ. Bhii tak, bɛ naabaazɛdjɛ yɛ nɛ nes, dáa Zɛɛb nakwyɛl ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6"/>Dáa di náá, Tit ɛ́ nakan mɛsa mɛ ɛsɛɛg esa binek pɛ daa len ɛ, bis eedjaala nɛ nɛ náá, nyɛ sik kɛsilal mbɛɛ mɛsa mɛ nyɛ nakan ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7"/>Bi ɛ́ bɛkum ɛ bot tɔ etɛp djas: tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, tɔ ɛgu ɛlii etɛp e Zɛɛb, tɔ zii di ààbɛ nɛ ɛsik ɛ, dɔɔ nɛ tɔ kwyɛl bi nakwyɛl bis ɛ. É di'enek, bi kwyɛl ɛ́ náá, bi lyaal ekum bin tɔ mbɛɛ mɛsa menek.<verse eid="2CO 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8"/>Sa mɛ di elii nɛ nen ɛ, mɛ ààbe mot bhel. Ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, mɛ nalii dum nɛ zii bɔn bɛsɔ bin nadi nɛ ye ɛ́. Ye ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, bi lyaal etsɛɛtsɛ di tɔ mɛkwyɛla men ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9"/>Etɛɛ náá, bi nɛ gu enɛm nɛ embɛɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto. Nyɛy mot nadi mot ekum ɔ, nyɛ eesa náá, nyɛ di tɔ edjel kɔ ɛsu ɛ len, étɛp bi needi bɛkum ɛ bot kɔ ɛsu ɛ edjel bɛ.<verse eid="2CO 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10"/>É mbu nadhaŋ'enek, biyɔ ɛ nadi bot ɛ mɛkɛn nake náá, bi ɛ́ waakwyee bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala ghaada Yeluzalɛm. Bi nazobaadi ɛ́ bot ɛ mɛkɛn é ɛkwyee bɛ. Deenek, mɛ ɛpelóo yam ɛkpa tɔ tɛp'enek. Ye ɛ́ di ɛnyɔɛpe étɛp'en, <verse eid="2CO 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11"/>nenak yak, silaleka ɛsa mɛsa mɛ tak. Waka zii tɔ ɛsilal ɛ mɛsa mɛ bi nakan ɛsa sok ɛ. Mot nɛ mot djɛ dáa nyɛ aabela ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12"/>Ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, mot ɛpekwyɛl ɛgwyena sonok nɛ mbɛɛ lyem ɔɔ, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waamyaal ɛkɛɛ ɛ lɛ. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ djɛ ɛ́ djala nɛ bim nyɛ di ebela ɛ, ààbɛ dum nɛ sa nyɛ di ààbela ɛ.<verse eid="2CO 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13"/>Ye tok náá, bɛ saŋ ɛ́ ɛwa bin tɔ edjel, étɛp ɛkwyee bot ɛ sis. Tin, ye ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, bot djas needi djala. <verse eid="2CO 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14"/>Nenak yak, bi ɛ́ nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ ekum. Tin, bi ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛkwyee bot ɛ di tɔ edjel ɔ. Deenek, dwoo biyɔ aakadi nɛ gwyes sonok ɛ, da bɔɔ ɛ́ di nɛ ekum ɔ, bɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛkazyɛ zɛkwyee bin. Ye ɛ́ deenek ɛ bi nɛ bɛ nɔɔ aakadi djala. <verse eid="2CO 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15"/>Ye ɛ́ dáa ekwyala di elɛɛ ɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 8:15">«Mot natek ɛbuɛpe ɔ, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààdi nɛ yɛ dhaa nyel.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 8:15">Mot natek batsa ɔ, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààdi tɔ pwom tak<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:18">Ɛwy 16.18</ref>.</char></note>.»<verse eid="2CO 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tit nɛ bɛdhiiti ekeletyɛ naazɛtɔ́ pɛ ghaada Koolɛt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16"/>Duu nɛ Zɛɛb, mot nadjɛ Tit bɛtɛ nɛ zii kɔ ɛsu ɛ len, dáa bis di nɛ yɛ nɛ nen ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17"/>Tit eemyaal sa bis nawaab nɛ nɛ ɛ, nɛ zii djas. Tin, nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet nɛ lyem'ɛ, nyɛ naamyal ɛsik pɛ daa len sika sis. <verse eid="2CO 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18"/>Bis eedhis Tit bɛ nɛ dhiiti mɔn nyɛɛg'ena. Mɔn nyɛɛg'ena yenɔk, bot ɛbuɛpe tɔ ezɛɛga mendjaala djas di etaŋal, dum nɛ dáa nyɛ di egu ɛgoola mɛkpa mɛ Zɛɛb ɛnyɔɛpe ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19"/>Dhiiti mɛsɔ mɛ bis dhis nyɛ ɛ́, ye ɛ́ náá, bot ɛ zɛɛga ndjaa mendjaala djas nazesɛ́ɛa nyɛ, dáa mot di egyee nɛ nes tɔ mɛdjoŋ mɛ bis tɔ́ kɛkyeed epata na sɛɛgaa ɛ pɛ Yelusalɛm. Ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, bis nadi esa mɛsa menek ɛ, ye ɛ́ étɛp Ghɛŋ nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet. Etɛɛ náá, bis ɛpekwyɛl ɛlyaal zii yes étɛp ɛkwyee bɛ.<verse eid="2CO 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20"/>Epata bɛ nadjɛ bis ɛ nadi ɛ́ ɛbuɛpe. Tin, bis ɛpebe ye ɛnyɔɛpe é kaab náá, bot ɛzɛkɛlii nɛ nes ɛbiyoɛpe náá, bis ààpabe ye ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="2CO 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21"/>Bis ɛpekwyɛl ɛsa enɛm esa. Bis kwyɛl ɛsa enɛm esa tak ɛ é mis mɛ Ghɛŋ, dɔɔ nɛ é mis mɛ bot djas.<verse eid="2CO 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22"/>Bis ɛpedhis dhiiti mɔn nyɛɛg'es étɛp nyɛ neegyee sama nɛ nɔɔ. Bis naadyeebadjɛ nyɛ mɛsa, nyɛ nadi esesa mɛsa mɛ tak djas ɛ nɛ zii. Nenak, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ zii ɛbuɛpe kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛbwaalel ɛ nyɛ di nɛ yɛ nɛ nen ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23"/>Yɛ kabɛ Tit ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ mot bis nɛ nɛ di egyee ɔ. Nyɛ ɛ́ mot bis nɛ nɛ di esa mɛsa mɛ ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal étɛp'en ɔ. Yɛ kabɛ bɔn nyɛɛg bis, bot ɛ di gyee sama nɛ nɛ ɔ, bɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ ezɛɛga ndjaa mendjaala lwom ɔ. Ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, bɛ ɛpesa mɛsa menek ɔɔ, bɛ sa ɛ étɛp duma ɛ Klisto. <verse eid="2CO 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24"/>Deenek, lyaalka bɛ náá, bi nɛ kwyɛl bɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ. É di'enek, bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala aagu náá, bis nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ gham ɛghɛɛ mɛnyel kɔ ɛsu ɛ len, é mis mɔɔ.<verse eid="2CO 8:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9"/>
  <para style="s">Zɛɛb nɛ kwyɛl mot di edjɛ nɛ lyem mɛmyaala ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1"/>Ye ɛ́ ɛnyɔɛpe náá, mɛ baakwyal bin mɛkana kɔ ɛsu mɛtom mɛ nakyeedaa, étɛp bot ɛ Zɛɛb di pɛ ghaada Yelusalɛm e? <verse eid="2CO 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2"/>Etɛɛ náá, mɛ nɛ gu mbɛɛ ɛkwosak ɛ len. Ye ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ, mɛ naadyeebaghɛɛ nyel kɔ ɛsu ɛ len é mis mɛ bot ɛ kyee dik Masedwan. Mɛ naalɛɛ bɛ náá: «Bɔn nyɛɛg bina pɛ kyee dik Akayi naaloozekobal mɛtom mɔɔ é mbu nadhaŋ'enek, étɛp ɛkwyee bɔn nyɛɛg di pɛ ghaada Yelusalɛm ɛ.» Tin, zii yen naadjɛ mɛghaaz nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ bot pak'ɔɔ. <verse eid="2CO 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3"/>Bela náá, mɛ dhis bɔn nyɛɛg bina tak ɛ, etɛɛ náá, ɛghɛɛ mɛnyel mɛ bis naghɛɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ len nadi yii gwyes. Ɛkwosak ɛ lam ɛ́ náá, esa bi kwom ɛ, ye di moo koobela é ɛzyɛ ɛ lena dáa mɛ nake ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4"/>Bis nɛ bot ɛ kyee dik Masedwan ɛzyɛ sama wat pɛ daa len ɔɔ, bis ɛdi ààkabela náá, bi eezekoobal esa djas ɔɔ. É di'enek, ye aadi ɛ́ boo syen nɛ nes etɛɛ náá, bis naadyeebawa ɛbwaalel nɛ nen. Mɛ bee ɛ́ ɛkɛɛ, biyɔ bɛmet aazobaadi ɛ́ nɛ syen é mis mɔɔ. <verse eid="2CO 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5"/>Étɛp tak ɛ mɛ gek náá, mɛ lel ɛdhis bɔn nyɛɛg bina étɛp bɛ needjɛ bin mɛghaaz tɔ ɛkwom ɛ esa ee bi nakɛk bɛdjel ɛ bot yɛ ɔ. Deenek, é ghɛŋ mɛ aazyɛ ɛ́, mɛ aabela ɛ́ esonok djas moo sɛɛga. É di'enek, ye aalyaal ɛ́ náá, bi djɛ yɛ ɛ nɛ lyem wat, ààbɛ nɛ bhel.<verse eid="2CO 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6"/>Guka náá, tɔ pyeeb mot ɛbɛ bhek batsa ɔɔ, nyɛ aazogó edee ɛ́ batsa. Tin, mot ɛbɛ bhek ɛbuɛpe tɔ pyeeb ɔɔ, nyɛ aagó edee ɛ́ ɛbuɛpe. <verse eid="2CO 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7"/>Ye nyɔ ɛ́ náá, mot nɛ mot djɛ dáa nyɛ gek tɔ lyem'ɛ ɛ, ààbɛ nɛ bhel, ààbɛ nɛ ɛbuk. Etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb kwyɛl ɛ́ mot di ekaa tɔ mɛmyaala ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8"/>Tin, Zɛɛb ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛdjɛ bin membi mɛ mɛvu djas. Etɛɛ náá mɛlu djas bi needi ààdi tɔ pwom sa wat. Bi needi nɛ bɛtɛ esa djas bi di egoka nɛ aasa membi mɛ enɛm esa djas nɛ ye ɛ́. <verse eid="2CO 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9"/>Ye ɛ́ dáa ekwyala di elɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">«Nyɛ nɛ gwyena nɛ bɛdjel ɛ bot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">enɛm esa bɛ ɛ́ kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 112:9">Mɛd 112.9</ref>.</char></note>.»<verse eid="2CO 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10"/>Zɛɛb ɛ́ di djɛ bhek nɛ mbɛel pyeeb, nyɛ ɛ́ baadi edjɛ nyɛ edee nyɛ di edɛ ɛ. Nyɛ waadjɛ bin membi mɛ mɛbhek djas ee bi di nɛ gwyee tak ɛ. Nyɛ waasa náá, ye wyee ɛnyɔɛpe etɛɛ náá, bi neegó bɛtɛ nɛ edee tɔ epyeeb'ɔ, dɔɔ nɛ enɛm esa bi sa ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11"/>Zɛɛb ɛ́ waasa náá, bi gheedidi nɛ kɔkɔ mbi ekum djas, etɛɛ náá, bi neegheesesa enɛm esa. Deenek, bɛtɛ nɛ bot ɛ́ waaghapɛɛ Zɛɛb, étɛp esa ee bi di edhis nɛ nes náá, bis djɛ bɛ ɛ.<verse eid="2CO 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12"/>Etɛɛ náá, enɛm esa ee bi di esa tɔ mɛsa mɛ ɛsɛɛg nɛ ɛkaa mɛtom, ye tok étɛp ɛkwyee bot ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ bot ɛ Zɛɛb toto. Ye ɛ́ waasa náá, bɛtɛ nɛ bot gheebubulal bhɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="2CO 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13"/>Bɛ waabee náá, enɛm esa bin nɛ bɔk. Tin, bɛ waabulal bhɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb etɛɛ náá, bi naadjɛaa mɛsa mɛ ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Klisto, bi ɛpelooba nɛ nɛ. Bɛ waabaadjɛ duu nɛ Zɛɛb, etɛɛ náá, bi ɛpesa mɛsa mɛ tak nɛ mbɛɛ lyem nɛ nes, dɔɔ nɛ bɛdhiiti bot. <verse eid="2CO 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14"/>Bɛ waadjaala Zɛɛb étɛp'en, nɛ ɛlyaal bin kwyɛl'ɔɔ kɔ ɛsu ɛ bɛtɛ nɛ enɛm nɛ esa ee Zɛɛb sa bin ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15"/>Duu nɛ Zɛɛb étɛp bɛtɛ nɛ enɛm esa bɛ di náá, dhiiti mot kɔ bɔs tok nɛ ghwyil ɛlaa-laŋak.<verse eid="2CO 9:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10"/>
  <para style="s">Taŋal ɛ Pɔl dum nɛ mɛsa mɛ mot-lwoma ee nyɛ di esa ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1"/>Mam Pɔl, mɛ lii nɛ nen ɛ nɛ din ɛ Klisto, nyɛy mot di mot mɛtela nɛ mbɛɛ lyem ɔ. Bi nɛ lii nɛ din ɛ lam náá: «Eghɛŋ mena dyeebadika é di wat nɛ nɛ ɛ, nyɛ nɛ tela lyem. Yɛ kabɛ é ghɛŋ mena nɛ bɛ nɔɔ di ààdika é di wat ɛ, nyɛ nɛ goo lyem.» <verse eid="2CO 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2"/>Mɛ ɛpedjaala nɛ nen, sa bi ààsa náá, mɛ goo lyem é ghɛŋ mɛ aadi pak'en ɛ. Tin, bɛdhiiti bot kɔɔ bot ɛ́ náá, bis sa étɛp ɛ dáa bot ɛ bɔs'ak. Deenek, nɛ mbi binɔk bot, mɛ aalii nɛ nɔɔ ɛbiyoɛpe. <verse eid="2CO 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3"/>Ye ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, menaka ɛ́ bot nɛ nyel epuud. Tin, tuub mena di eduuk'aak, ye tok tuub epuud. <verse eid="2CO 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4"/>Tin, bɛghɛl mɛ mena di eduuka nɛ ye ɛ́, ye tok bɛghɛl bot ɛ bɔs. Ye ɛ́ elyel-lyel bɛghɛl e Zɛɛb. Ye ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛtwaal elyel-lyel mendjaa ee bot ɛ mɛbhuka ɛ Zɛɛb di kɛsɔwa tɔ tak ɔ. Ye ɛ́ tyee wat, dáa mena di esaabeka esiiza ee di ààbɛ tɔ etsɛɛtsɛ ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5"/>Mena ɛpekwyesal djɛ sɔs egeka bot ɛ ɛghɛa nyel djas di elii, étɛp ɛlu náá, bɛdhiiti bot needi ààgu Zɛɛb. Mena kwyɛlka ɛ, ɛpana egeka e bot ɛ di ààgu Zɛɛb ɔ, étɛp bɛ neelooba nɛ Klisto. <verse eid="2CO 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6"/>Eghɛŋ bi aadi bi moo elooba nɛ Klisto dáa di egoka nɛ sael ɛ. Tin, mena aadika nɛ ghwyil ɛdul bot djas di ààlooba nɛ Klisto ɛ mɛlɔ.<verse eid="2CO 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7"/>Bɛɛka mis ɛnyɔɛpe. Mot ɛ myaam nɛ lyem'ɛ ɛmet náá, nyɛ ɛ́ mot ɛ Klisto ɔɔ. Ye goka ɛ́ nyɛ di etaala náá, bisɔ pe ɛ́ bot ɛ Klisto. <verse eid="2CO 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8"/>Ye ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, mɛ naghɛɛ nyel kɔ ɛsu ɛ ekukuma ee Ghɛŋ Yezu nadjɛ mena ɛ. Ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, mɛ tok nɛ syen etɛp tak. Ye ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb nabɛ ɛ́ ààdjɛ mɛ ekukuma tak, mɛ neepul bin. Nyɛ nadjɛ mɛ ye ɛ́, étɛp mɛ needjɛ bin mɛghaaaz. <verse eid="2CO 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9"/>Tin, mɛ ààpakwyɛl náá, egeka bin di náá, mɛ ɛpebɛɛg bin nɛ bɛmɛkana mam. <verse eid="2CO 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10"/>Etɛɛ náá, bɛdhiiti bot ke ɛ́ náá: «Bɛmɛkana mɛ Pɔl nɛ lyel ɛ mɛkpa, ye tok fyaŋa. Tin, é mis dáak, wɔ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛ ɛwyɛlɛ nyɛ. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ lii ɛ́ dáa mot di ààlyel bham ɛ.» <verse eid="2CO 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11"/>Ye goka ɛ́ mot di elii deenek ɔ gu náá, sa bis di elɛɛ tɔ bɛmɛkana mes é sok bis di ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ nen ɛ, bis aazosa ɛ́ deenek é ghɛŋ bis aakum pak'en ɛ.<verse eid="2CO 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12"/>Bɛdhiiti bot nɛ kwyɛl ɛduwal mɛnyel mɔɔ. Tin, bis tok nɛ ghwyil ɛke náá, bis nɛ bɛ nɔɔ ɛ́ tyɛ wat. Bɛ nɛ kwyɛl ɛgwyala mɛfulu pak'ɔɔ. Bis ààpakwyɛl ɛbaŋa bɛ. Bɛ nɛ yɔbɔ kɔkɔ mbi kyeed bɛ di ekɛ pak'ɔɔ. Yenek tok etɛp ewo? <verse eid="2CO 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13"/>Yɛ kabɛ bisɔ ɔ, bis tok nɛ ghwyil ɛghɛɛ mɛnyel kɛdhaa. Ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, bis ɛpeghɛɛ mɛnyel ɔ, bis goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛghɛɛ mɛnyel ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb nadjɛ bis ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14"/>Deenek, é ghɛŋ bis nazyɛ pɛ daa len nɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Klisto ɛ, bis nabɛ ɛ́ ààdi nɛ «tɔɔ kɛsee» kɔ mɛsa Zɛɛb nadjɛ bis ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15"/>Bis ààghɛɛ nyel nɛ mɛsa mɛ bɛdhiiti bot nasa ɛ, mɛsa mɔɔ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ yii Zɛɛb nadjɛ bis náá, bis sa ɛ. Tin, bis ɛ́ nɛ ɛbwaalel náá, bi aadi ɛ́ ghiŋ tɔ ɛdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. Ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ Zɛɛb moo ɛ́ ɛlyelɛpe ɛ, mɛsa mɛ bis di esa nɛ nen ɛ waabyet dáa Zɛɛb nalɛɛ náá, bis sa ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16"/>Nenak, bis moo kwyɛl ɛtɔ́ kɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal pɛ kyee mɛdhik mɛ di ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ nen ɛ. Bis aanàghɛɛ mɛnyel nɛ mɛsa mɛ bɛdhiiti bot nasa ɛ.<verse eid="2CO 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17"/>Ghuna, ekwyala lɛɛ ɛ́ náá: «Ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, mot ɛpekwyɛl ɛghɛɛ nyel ɔɔ, nyɛ sa yɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ sa Ghɛŋ sa ɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:23">Zel 9.23</ref>.</char></note>.» <verse eid="2CO 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18"/>Etɛɛ náá, Ghɛŋ ààkwyɛl náá, mot nyɛ ɛmet duwal nyel'ɛ. Tin, ye àànyɔ náá, ye sael deenek. Etɛɛ náá, Ghɛŋ ɛben mot ɔɔ, ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ náá, nyɛ eemyaal mɛsa mɛ mot'enɔk.<verse eid="2CO 10:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11"/>
  <para style="s">Pɔl bɛ nɛ bɛmbee bot ɛ lwoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1"/>Mɛ kwyɛl ɛ́ náá, bi pel é wo bam; pookopelka mɛlyet mam batsa! <verse eid="2CO 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2"/>Mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ɛwu kɔ ɛsu ɛ len, ɛwu ɛ́ di náá, ye dus ɛ́ pɛ daa Zɛɛb ɛ. Ɛwu ɛ́ tak ɛ, etɛɛ náá, mɛ naabaal bin ɛ, étɛp ɛdjɛ bin é ɛbá nɛ motom ngɔt, motom tak ɛ Yezu Klisto. Mɛ ɛpekwyɛl ɛtel bin daa lɛ dáa mɔn syes moma di ààgu botom ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3"/>Taalaka dáa nyɔ nakwak Ɛve nɛ mbee mɛkɔŋ mɛ ɛ. Tin, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ kɛŋ nɛ nen, mɛ kaab ɛ́ náá, mot ɛzɛkɛkɔɔ bin da swola egeka bin, étɛp bi neelum koŋ nɛ etsɛɛtsɛ, da di ààdi tɔ epiki nɛ Klisto. <verse eid="2CO 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4"/>Bi nɛ dyeebakwyɛl náá, dhiiti mot zɛgoola bin dhiiti mbi Yezu sis. Yezu tak àànɔŋel nɛ yii bis nagoola bin ɛ. Deenek, bi ɛ́ pe ɛ ghwyɛ étɛp ɛmyaal dhiiti mbi sisim nɛ di ezyaala nɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ, bi nabela ɛ. Bi ɛ́ ghwyɛ étɛp ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ dhiiti mbi bhaadal di àànɔŋel nɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal, bis nagoola bin ɛ.<verse eid="2CO 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5"/>Mɛ nɛ gu náá, bot ɛ bi di eke náá, bɛ ɛ́ «eboo ewolo bot ɛ lwoma ɔ». Mɛ ààbee náá, bɛ eedhaa mɛ nɛ dhiiti sonok. <verse eid="2CO 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6"/>Ye ɛ́ di náá, mɛ ààgu ɛlii dáa bɔɔ ɔ. Bela náá, mɛ tok mot di ààgu sonok dum nɛ etɛp e Zɛɛb. Bis naalyaal bin etɛp e tak popoopwon esok nɛ esok, e mɛwala djas.<verse eid="2CO 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7"/>Eghɛŋ mɛ nadi egoola bin Mbɛɛ Bhaadal Zɛɛb ɛ, mɛ nasa ye ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ efute. Mam eenɔɔ di edhyeeb étɛp mɛ needjɛ bin di ekukuma. Dáa mɛ sa deenek ɛ ye ɛ́ ɛbiyoɛpe? <verse eid="2CO 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8"/>Eghɛŋ mɛ nadi esa mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb pɛ yebɔ ɛ, bot ɛ ezɛɛga mendjaala mɛsis nadi edjɛ mɛbyok mɛ epata dáa efute. Ye ɛ́ nɛ mɛbyok mɛ epata ee mɛ nadi enɔɔ pɛ daa lɔɔ ɛ, mɛ nabela ghwyil ɛkwyee ɛ bin. <verse eid="2CO 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9"/>Eghɛŋ mɛ nadi pɛ yebɔ ɛ, mɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ gwyes pata. Tin, mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààwaab bin sonok. Bɔn nyɛɛg nadus pɛ kyee dik Masedwan ɛ naazyɛ mɛ nɛ esa mɛ nadi nɛ gwyes tak ɛ. Deenek, mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkwyɛl náá, mot zuk kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam. Nenak, mɛ aanàkobet náá, mot zuk kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam. <verse eid="2CO 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10"/>Dum nɛ etsɛɛtsɛ ɛ Klisto di tɔ lam ɛ, mɛ lɛɛ náá: pɛ kyee dik Akayi, mot tok nɛ ghwyil ɛlu mɛ náá, mɛ myak bet kɔ ɛsu ɛ mɛsa mɛ mɛ nasa penek, ààwaab efute nɛ mot ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11"/>Étɛp yé mɛ lii deenek? Ye ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, mɛ ààkwyɛl bin e? Zɛɛb nɛ gu náá, mɛ nɛ kwyɛl bin.<verse eid="2CO 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12"/>Sa mɛ di esa nenak ɛ, ye ɛ́ sa mɛ aasesa mɛlu djas ɛ. Mɛ sa deenek ɛ, ekaab náá, bɛ ɛzɛkɛbela lo mɛsɔ mɛ bɛ aaghɛɛ mɛnyel náá, bis nɛ bɛ nɔɔ tyɛ wat ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13"/>Bot binɔk ɛ́ bɛmbee bot ɛ lwoma, bɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ djii di ekɔɔ bot náá, bɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ lwoma ɛ Klisto ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14"/>Ye tok nɛ tɛp ɛdjoka tin. Etɛɛ náá, Satan nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet nɛ kɔɔ bot náá, nyɛ ɛ́ di fofop mɛkas. <verse eid="2CO 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15"/>Bot tok nɛ ghwyil ɛdjoka, é ghɛŋ bot ɛ mɛsa ɛ Satan binɔk di ekɔɔ bot náá, bɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ mɛsa ɛ Zɛɛb, mot epiki ɛ. Tin, bɛ aabela efute di egoka nɛ mɛsa mɔɔ ɛ.<verse eid="2CO 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mezuk ɛ Pɔl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16"/>Mɛ ɛpebaabasal náá, sa mot ààbee mɛ dáa mot mɛlyet. Bɛ gek deenek ɔɔ, tin myaalka náá, mɛ ɛ́ mot mɛlyet etɛɛ náá, mɛ neebaadi nɛ ɛbi bet kɔ ɛsu ɛ len. <verse eid="2CO 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17"/>Ye tok Ghɛŋ di eke náá, mɛ di mot ɛdiig ɛ bet dáa mɛ di ekwos ɛ. Eghɛŋ mɛ di ediig bet ɛ, mɛ lii ɛ́ dáa mot mɛlyet. <verse eid="2CO 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18"/>Dáa ye di náá, bot ɛ bɔs'ak nɛ bi bet ɛ, ye goka ɛ́ mam pe mɛ bi bet. <verse eid="2CO 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19"/>Bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛgwak ɛ mɛ, etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ di bɛtsoŋ ɛ bot. Tin, bi nɛ myaal ɛgwak mɛlyo mɛ bot ɛ mɛlyet, nɛ lyem wat. <verse eid="2CO 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20"/>Bi nɛ myaala náá, bot binɔk tiig bin dáa ekwom, bɛ di esilal epata bin, bɛ djii esa bin djas, bɛ wyɛlɛ bin, bɛ myak bin bɛɛz e bhwoob. <verse eid="2CO 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21"/>Bi gek bilak ɛ náá, bis nadi ààsa deenek nen ɛ etɛɛ náá, bis ɛ́ bɛtsabel e? «Aah» ɛ syen nɛ mbi yenek tɛp!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, dhiiti mot ɛ nɛ sa nyɛ di egoka nɛ ɛbi bet kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɔɔ, mam pe ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛsa yɛ. Ye nakoozodi náá, é ghɛŋ mɛ di elii deenek ɛ́, mɛ lii ɛ́ dáa mot mɛlyet. <verse eid="2CO 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22"/>Bɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ mbyak ebhele e? Dɔɔ nɛ mam pe, mɛ ɛ́ mot mbyak ebhele. Bɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ kyee dik Yisalaɛl e? Dɔɔ nɛ mam pe ɛ́ mot kyee dik Yisalaɛl. Bɛ ɛ́ bɛdha ɛ Abalaam e? Dɔɔ nɛ mam pe ɛ́ dha ɛ Abalaam. <verse eid="2CO 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23"/>Mɛ kalii nenak wak ɛ́, dáa mot mɛlyet. Bɛ ke ɛ́ náá, bɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ mɛsa ɛ Klisto? Mam pe ɛ́ mot-mɛsa ɛ Klisto dhaa bɔɔ. Mɛ naazuk tɔ mɛsa mɛ Klisto dhaa bɔɔ. Mɛ naani tɔ membok esok nɛ esok dhaa bɔɔ. Mɛ naabyaa dhaa bɔɔ. Mɛ naadi tɔ mezuk esok nɛ esok, sa ye aakɛkunaa-kunaa nɛ ɛsyee dhaa bɔɔ. <verse eid="2CO 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24"/>Ekukuma eYuda naamɛt mɛ esok etɛn, bɛ nanyunyuu mɛ nɛ ghwyɛs ɛ esok mɛkam-mɛlɛl nɛ etɛn nɛ ená (39), <verse eid="2CO 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25"/>bot ɛ mbyak eLɔm naamyak mɛ nɛ ebhil e ele esok elɛl. Sok wat, bɛ naabaal mɛ é ghɛŋ bɛ nawus mɛ nɛ mɛkok ɛ. Esok elɛl, mɛ naadi ediiga tɔ bɛmɛsuwa e mɛdjoŋ. Sok wat, mɛ naadhaa tu mwos nɛ tu pum tɔ boo dii mɛsɔn. <verse eid="2CO 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26"/>Tɔ bɛtɛ nɛ mɛdjoŋ mɛ mɛ nadi esa ɛ, mɛ naaboma nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ mezuk. Mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ tɔ mezuk é mɛdjoŋ mam é ghɛŋ mɛ nadi etsaal eboo mɛdii tɔ bhyoŋ ɛ. Mɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ mbee bwoo ekaab bot ɛ ɛzɛm, é sok mɛ nadi tɔ mɛdjoŋ ɛ. Mɛ naaboma nɛ bɔn nyɛɛg bam bot ɛ mbyak eYuda, nɛghu bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ. Mɛ naazuk tɔ eboo eghaada, nɛghu tɔ mɛdhik, nɛghu naazuk tɔ boo dii mɛsɔn. Mɛ naabaazuk tɔ mɛmbɔ mɛ bɛmbee bɔn nyɛɛg. <verse eid="2CO 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27"/>Mɛ naaboma nɛ mɛsa mɛ na lyel-lyel nɛ eboo mɛbhowal. Tin, mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààdi edje-dja gɔ, mɛ naagwak za étɛp pwom edee, mɛ naagwak gwyes mɛdii, mɛ naadi tɔ pwom edee, mɛ naazuk nɛ ɛgwyoo nɛ eduuba. <verse eid="2CO 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28"/>Ye ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti mezuk mɛ di náá, mɛ ààpalaŋ ɛ. Sa mɛ di ebee nɛ boo mɛtaŋ é yam mis ɛ́ náá, lyem'am nɛ taala ngwyis bot ɛ ezɛɛga mendjaa mɛ mendjaala djas. <verse eid="2CO 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29"/>Eghɛŋ mot di ààpyet tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, ye kpaa mɛ lyem ɛkɛɛ ye ɛ́ mam. Eghɛŋ mot di esyem ɛ, ye nɛ kpaa mɛ lyem dhaa tyɛ.<verse eid="2CO 11:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30"/>Ye ɛ́ bɛ sa ɛghɛa nyel ɔɔ, mɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛghɛɛ nyel ɛ kɔ esa ee mɛ di ebee náá, mɛ ààkwak ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31"/>Zɛɛb, Sɛɛg ɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu nɛ gu ɛnyɔɛpe náá, mɛ ààkɔɔ. Beta náá, duu di nɛ nɛ kɔm sii nɛ kɔm. <verse eid="2CO 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32"/>Eghɛŋ mɛ nadi pɛ ghaada Dhamas ɛ, kukuma nadi ebɔɔba mɛkoozi Aaletas ɔ, naanɛɛg esodja é ɛniel ɛ ghaada étɛp bɛ neemɛt mɛ. <verse eid="2CO 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33"/>Tin, bɛ naawa mɛ tɔ djhan, kɔl ekel e tak. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛkwyɛɛg mɛ e ɛyen ɛ boo pap ghaada. Ye ɛ́ deenek ɛ, nyɛ nadi ààmɛt mɛ.<verse eid="2CO 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12"/>
  <para style="s">Pɔl ɛmyaala nɛ ɛzuk étɛp mɛsa mɛ Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1"/>Ye goka ɛ́ mɛ di nɛ ɛghɛa nyel, bela náá, ɛbi bet ye tok ɛnyɔɛpe. Tin, mɛ kalii nenak ɛ, kɔ ɛsu ɛ mɛdhyam nɛ esa Ghɛŋ natel mɛ ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2"/>Mɛ nɛ gu dhiiti keletyɛ nabyet tɔ́ pɛ tɔ gwoo, ye moo mos ɛ́ membu kam nɛ ená (14). Deenek, mɛ ààgu nɛ koo, ye nabɛ ɛ́ dhyam nɛghu ye ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, nyɛ naabyet tɔ́ pɛ tɔ gwoo di Zɛɛb di ɔɔ. Tin, Zɛɛb nyɛ ɛmet ɛ di egu. <verse eid="2CO 12:2"/><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3-4"/>Tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ nɛ gu náá, mot tak naabyet kɛkum pɛ tɔ Paladi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.3-4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Paladi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ye kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ, mɔn bok ɛ Zɛɛb edi nyɛ di ɔ.</char></note>. Mɛ ààgu ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́ dhyam nɛghu ye ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ. Tin, Zɛɛb nyɛ ɛmet ɛ di egu. Penek pɛ tɔ gwoo, nyɛ naagwak mɛkpa wat di náá, dhiiti mot tok nɛ ghwyil ɛ baŋa ye ɛ́. Sa mot ààkolii-liiak kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak. <verse eid="2CO 12:3-4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5"/>Mɛ waadi nɛ ghwyil ɛghɛɛ nyel dum nɛ mot yenɔk. Tin, ye ɛ́ kabɛ mam ɔ, mɛ aazodi nɛ ɛghɛɛ nyel ɛ, kɔ ɛsu sa mɛ di ààdi nɛ ghwyil ɛsa ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6"/>Ye ɛ́ pe di ɛ́ di náá, mɛ ɛpekwyɛl ɛghɛɛ nyel ɔɔ, pe mɛ aanàdi tyee mot mɛlyet, etɛɛ náá, mɛ waalɛɛ ɛ́ etsɛɛtsɛ. Tin, mɛ aanàkwaaghɛɛ nyel. Etɛɛ náá, mɛ ghɛɛ nyel ɔɔ, bot ɛ ghwyil ɛbee mɛ dáa boo-mot ɛ duu. Mɛ kwyɛl ɛ náá, bot pɛ́ɛ mɛ dum nɛ sa mɛ nakɛk ɛsa ɛ, nɛ yii bɛ di egwak mɛ elii ɛ.<verse eid="2CO 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7"/>Deenek, mɛ needi ààdi nɛ ɛbet kɔ ɛsu ɛ eboo esa e mɛbwala ee Zɛɛb zetel mɛ ɛ. Deenek, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti boo pel tɔ nyel dáa ɛgɔak. Ye ɛ́ dáa Satan nalwom fofop'ɛ, étɛp nyɛ neezɛwa mɛ tɔ tsik mezuk. Ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, Zɛɛb naabet náá, ye sael deenek ɔɔ, ye ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, mɛ needi ààsa ɛbet. <verse eid="2CO 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8"/>Mɛ eedjaala nɛ Ghɛŋ esok elɛl, étɛp nyɛ neepɛk mɛ tɔ tsik mezuk mak. <verse eid="2CO 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9"/>Nyɛ naabɔɔza nɛ nam ɛ náá: «Enɛm nɛ embɛɛ bam eedjala nɛ nɔ. Mɛbwala mam dyeebanyen ɛ, é sok wɔ di ààdi nɛ ghwyil ɛsa dhiiti sonok ɛ.» Mɛ kwyɛl ɛ́ mɛ di nɛ ɛghɛɛa nyel dum nɛ sa di náá, mɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛsa ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, mɛbwala ɛ Klisto neebaal mɛ. <verse eid="2CO 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10"/>Dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ, mɛ di emyaala nɛ sa mɛ di ààdi nɛ ghwyil ɛsa ɛ. Mɛ nɛ myaala nɛ mɛlee, mezuk, mɛtiiga, etɛp di kpaa mɛ lyem kɔ ɛsu ɛ Klisto ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, é sok mɛ di ààdi nɛ ghwyil ɛsa sonok ɛ, ye ɛ́ é di'enek ɛ mɛ di nɛ ghwyil.<verse eid="2CO 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl ɛpebem ba kɔ ɛsu bot ɛ Koolɛt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11"/>Ye ɛ́ biyɔ ɛbesal mɛ náá, mɛ lii tyee mot mɛlyet, ye ɛ́ biyɔ nawaakotaŋal e di yam. Ye nakoozodi náá, mɛ tok vaŋ mot. Tin, ye tok nɛ sa wat ee bot ɛ́ ee bi di edjóo «eboo ewolo bot ɛ lwoma» di edhaa mɛ nɛ yɛ. <verse eid="2CO 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12"/>Endem di elyaal náá, mɛ ɛ́ mot-lwoma ɔ, bi naazebee yɛ nɛ mis men met. Ye naanyen tɔ zii, tɔ membi mɛ endem e mɛbwala, tɔ bɛmɛvyɛkɛlɛ nɛ tɔ mɛbwala. <verse eid="2CO 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13"/>Yaa mbi sonok bi nadi ààbela dhaa bɛdhiiti bot ɛ ezɛɛga mendjaala? Ye di ààdi étɛp mɛ nabyen náá, bi nàkwyee mɛ ɛ. Ye ɛ́ di étɛp tak ɔɔ, pelka mɛ.<verse eid="2CO 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14"/>Mɛ moo aakɔ nɛ ɛzyɛ pɛ yibɔ, zya esok elɛl, ye tok náá, biyɔ aakwaaswok nɛ etɛp bam djas. Ye ɛ́ biyɔ ɛ mɛ di ekwyɛl ɛbee, ààbɛ epata bin. Deenek, ye tok bɔn di esɛɛg epata étɛp bɛbyael bɔɔ. Tin, ye ɛ́ bɛbyael bɔɔ ɛ di esa deenek étɛp bɔn bɔɔ. <verse eid="2CO 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15"/>Yɛ kabɛ mam ɔ, mɛ aadi ɛ́ nɛ mɛmyaala e ɛsilal esa bam djas, nɛ ɛka nyel'am met étɛp'en. Mɛ nɛ kwyɛl bin dhaa tyɛ, mɛ bee ɛ náá, bi ààdyeebakwyɛl mɛ.<verse eid="2CO 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16"/>Bi nɛ gu ɛnyɔɛpe náá, mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààdi boo ɛbɛp kɔ ɛsu ɛ len. Tin, bɛdhiiti bot ɛ waake náá, «Pɔl ɛ́ mot mɛkɔŋ, nyɛ eekɔɔ bis.» Ààbɛ, ye tok deenek <verse eid="2CO 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17"/>Tɔ sama ɛ bot ɛ mɛ nadhis pɛ yebɔ ɛ, ye ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti mot pak'ɔɔ nanɔɔ esa bin tyee nɔŋa mɛkɔŋ, étɛp ɛzɛdjɛ mɛ? <verse eid="2CO 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18"/>Mɛ nadjaala nɛ Tit náá, nyɛ zyɛ pɛ daa len, bɛ nɛ mɔn nyɛɛg'es ee bi di egu yenɔk. Tit nanɔɔ esa bin tyee nɔŋa mɛkɔŋ e? Ààbɛ, bi nɛ gu ɛnyɔɛpe náá, ye tok deenek. Sa Tit nasa ɛ́ nɛ sa mam nasa ɛ́, ye tok sa wat e? Bis ɛ́ nɛ tok nɛ esiimza wat e?<verse eid="2CO 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19"/>Bi gek tɔ elyem bin ɛ náá, bis lii ɛ́ étɛp bis neebela gham é mis men. Ààbɛ, bis lii ɛ́ tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Klisto, é mis mɛ Zɛɛb. Bɔn nyɛɛg bam mɛ di ekwyɛl ɔ, bis lii nɛ nen etɛp binek djas ɛ, étɛp ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ Zɛɛb neetɔ́ sok. <verse eid="2CO 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20"/>Deenek, é sok mɛ aakum pɛ yebɔ ɛ, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ kɛŋ náá, mɛ ɛzɛkɛdi ààbela bin dáa mɛ nadi egek náá, mɛ aabela bin ɛ. Da biyɔ pe kazɛbela mɛ ààbɛ dáa bi di ekwyɛl ɛ. Sa mɛ di ekaab ɛ́ náá, ye nàdi nɛ mɛwɔ, nɛ mbee lyem, mɛbuk, zyaala, mɛlee, ɛbyak ɛ bot, ɛghɛɛ nyel nɛghu bhimis pak'en. <verse eid="2CO 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21"/>Mɛ ɛpekaab náá, e mɛdjoŋ mam di ezyɛ yenek, Zɛɛb'am ɛzɛkɛniigal mɛ syen étɛp mɛfulu men. Deenek, mɛ nɛ bwoo náá, mɛ zɛbela bɛtɛ nɛ bot di náá, bɛ dinaa ààpaswoola tsik'ɔɔ ɛ, ààkat mesyem, ààkat ɛsa mɛzɔ, nɛ ɛkat ɛsa embee esesɛɛ ee bɛ di zezyɛ nɛ ɛsa sok ɛ.<verse eid="2CO 12:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13"/>
  <para style="s">Mɛlyo ɛ Pɔl yii mɛsik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1"/>Zya esok elɛl ɛ́ yak ee mɛ di ekwyɛl ɛzyɛ pɛ yebɔ ɛ. Ekwyala lɛɛ ɛ́ náá: «Etɛp djas goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛliiaa ɛ, kɔ mɛkpa mɛ bɛtyaasɛs bɛbá nɛghu bɛlɛl<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Dɛt 19.15</ref>.</char></note>.» <verse eid="2CO 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2"/>Eghɛŋ mɛ nazyɛ pɛ yibɔ, é mɛdjoŋ mam yii esok ebá ɛ, mɛ naalɛka nɛ bot ɛ nasa mesyem ɔ, dɔɔ nɛ bɛdhiiti bot. Nenak, dáa mɛ di ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ nen ɛ, mɛ ɛpebaalɛka nɛ nen náá, esok mɛ aabaazyɛ pɛ yebɔ ɛ, mɛ aawa bɔɔ djas é feŋ. <verse eid="2CO 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3"/>Bi ɛpekwyɛl ɛgu ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, Klisto ɛ́ di elii tɔ lam e? Bi ɛ́ waagu. Klisto tok nɛ ghwyil ɛkat ɛsa dhiiti sonok é mis men. Tin, nyɛ waalyaal mɛbwala mɛ pak'en. <verse eid="2CO 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4"/>Ye ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, é ghɛŋ nyɛ nabemaa é mɛlaaba ɛ, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ ghwyil. Tin, nenak nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ tsik tɔ ghwyil ɛ Zɛɛb. Tɔ ɛgwakel ɛ lena nɛ nɛ, menabɛlka pe ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ ghwyil. Tin, bis ɛ́ waalyaal bin náá, bis ɛ́ nɛ tsik sama nɛ nɛ, kɔ ɛsu ɛ ghwyil ɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="2CO 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5"/>Sɔska sa bi di esa ɛ biyɔ bɛmet, ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, bi dinaa ekɛ tɔ ɛdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ. Ye tok deenek e? Tin, pookodjoalaka biyɔ bɛmet ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, kyeed bi di ekɛ ɛ ɛpegoka nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ Yezu Klisto. Ye ɛ́ di ààbɛ deenek ɔɔ, ye kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ náá, ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ Zɛɛb eezekwyit. <verse eid="2CO 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6"/>Tin, mɛ bee ɛ́ náá, bi ɛ́ waagu náá, bis ààpakwyɛ tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="2CO 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7"/>Bis ɛpedjaala nɛ Zɛɛb étɛp náá, bi needi ààsa sa ɛbiyo. Ye tok étɛp ɛlyaal bin náá, mɛsa mɛ bis nasa nɛ nen ɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ɛnyɔɛpe. Bis kwyɛl ɛ́ náá, bi sa enɛm esa ye nakoozodi náá, bis nabɛ ɛ́ ààsa mɛsa tɔ len ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="2CO 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8"/>Etɛɛ náá, bis tok nɛ ghwyil ɛsaab etsɛɛtsɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. Bis aazosa ɛ mɛsa mɛ etsɛɛtsɛ. <verse eid="2CO 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9"/>Bis nɛ myaala é ghɛŋ bis di ààbɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛsa dhiiti sonok ɛ, ghuna biyɔ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil. É di'enek, bis nɛ waab tɔ mendjaala mes náá, bi di tɔ esosoob. <verse eid="2CO 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10"/>Étɛp tak ɛ, mɛ di ekwyal bin mɛkana mak mam ɛtsɛtaɛpe nɛ nen. Etɛɛ náá, é sok mɛ aakum pɛ yebɔ ɛ, yɛ aabela bi eezeswoola mɛfulu. Tin, Ghɛŋ naadjɛ mɛ ekukuma ɛkɔk kɔ len, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààdjɛ ekukuma tak étɛp mɛ neepul bin, ye nabɛ ɛ́ étɛp bi neetɔ́ sok tɔ mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="2CO 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg bam, mɛ moo mwana nɛ nen, saaka bi tɔ́ sok tɔ mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb, djɛelka mɛghaaz pak'en da bi ɛ́ di tɔ ɛgwakel, dika tɔ egwyem. Tin, Zɛɛb mot di ekwyɛl bot ɔ, mot di edjɛ bot egwyem aadi ɛ́ sama nɛ nen.<verse eid="2CO 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12"/>Swoselka pak'en mɛswosel mɛ ɛboma mɛmuk nɛ bɔn nyɛɛg bina nɛ lyem e dɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 13:12">Bɔn nyɛɛg tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb eeswos bin. <verse eid="2CO 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13"/>Betka náá, enɛm nɛ embɛɛ e Ghɛŋ Yezu Klisto, kwyɛl ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ ɛgwakel tɔ Sisim na Dɛɛ di nɛ biyɔ djas.<verse eid="2CO 13:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13"/>
</usx>
